        "created_at": "2016-10-05T14:22:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the only time this game that has left me uninterested in playing for a while is the setup in Ridiculous Challenge Time posted by Peter Hayward. &nbsp; Other than that it's certainly been a game that has kept my interest much longer than I ever would have thought. &nbsp;It's the combination of mechanics and story behind that keep me wanting to play. &nbsp;</p>",
