        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-10-06T13:25:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Heh, I'm not even that interested in superheroes and yet Sentinels is one of my favourite non-computer games. One of the main reasons for this is probably the ridiculous level of replayability, though the fact that it's co-operative is probably the other main reason. I suppose it will be kind of sad when the last decks are finally released, but I'm sure we'll have many more years' worth of games to play even without adding in fan-made content such as the Cauldron :D.</p>",
